{"id":"C1-L036","title":"distinguish something from something — use","cefr":"C1","level":"C1","unit":"C1-U03","focus":"distinguish something from something — uso","targets":{"grammar":"distinguish something from something — uso","pron":"Organização da informação pela entonação","verbs":["deduce"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["disease outbreak","statistical noise","patchy data","treatment guideline","epidemiologist","viral strain","public health alert","infection rate","outbreak map","case cluster","contact tracing","surveillance system","data artifact","signal detection","field investigation","health authority","modeling team","transmission route","incubation period","vaccine rollout","death toll","clinical guideline"],"field":"Pesquisa","genre":"Biografia","skill":"Escrita","words_min":22},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 36 · distinguish something from something — use","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** distinguish something from something — uso.","**Verbos:** deduce.","**Pronúncia:** Organização da informação pela entonação.","**22 palavras novas** (pesquisa).","**Texto do dia:** biografia."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (C1):** eu consigo usar distinguish A from B e deduce numa biografia de um cientista, com precisão acadêmica."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **escrever frases claras e corretas (IELTS Writing, TOEFL Writing)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["disease outbreak","surto de doença"],["statistical noise","ruído estatístico"],["patchy data","dados incompletos"],["treatment guideline","diretriz de tratamento"],["epidemiologist","epidemiologista"],["viral strain","cepa viral"],["public health alert","alerta de saúde pública"],["infection rate","taxa de infecção"],["outbreak map","mapa do surto"],["case cluster","conjunto de casos"],["contact tracing","rastreamento de contatos"],["surveillance system","sistema de vigilância"],["data artifact","artefato de dados"],["signal detection","detecção de sinal"],["field investigation","investigação de campo"],["health authority","autoridade de saúde"],["modeling team","equipe de modelagem"],["transmission route","via de transmissão"],["incubation period","período de incubação"],["vaccine rollout","distribuição de vacinas"],["death toll","número de mortes"],["clinical guideline","protocolo clínico"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Dr. Lucas Ferraz (fictional)","paras":["Lucas Ferraz, a fictional epidemiologist, became known for his ability to **distinguish** real outbreaks **from** statistical noise. From patchy data he would **deduce** patterns that colleagues missed. “You must **tell** a signal **from** an artifact,” he told students.","His team **differentiated between** two similar viruses, **drawing a distinction** that changed treatment guidelines. Though modest, he **is credited with** saving thousands of lives."],"years":"b. 1962","facts":[["Job","epidemiologista"],["Skill","dedução a partir de dados"],["Impact","novas diretrizes"]],"gloss":[["outbreak","surto"],["patchy","incompleto"],["guideline","diretriz"],["artifact","artefato (falso sinal)"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ferraz distinguished real outbreaks from noise.","ans":"T","why":"distinguish real outbreaks from statistical noise."},{"q":"His data were always complete.","ans":"F","why":"patchy data."},{"q":"He is credited with saving lives.","ans":"T","why":"credited with."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“deduce” = ?","opts":["deduzir","deduzir só","dedicar"],"ans":0,"why":"deduce."},{"q":"“outbreak” = ?","opts":["surto","saída","fora de pausa"],"ans":0,"why":"outbreaks."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"distinguish — uso em contextos acadêmicos","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["distinguish A from B","**He distinguished outbreaks from noise.**"],["tell A from B","**Tell a signal from an artifact.**"],["differentiate between A and B","**They differentiated between two viruses.**"],["deduce (that) / deduce A from B","**He deduced patterns from patchy data.**"]],"cap":"distinguish — uso em contextos acadêmicos"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**deduce** = chegar a uma conclusão lógica a partir de **fatos**; **infer** = a partir de **indícios**; **assume** = sem prova."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"He could distinguish outbreaks ___ noise. (from)","a":"from","why":"distinguish from."},{"s":"From patchy data he would ___ patterns. (deduce)","a":"deduce","why":"verbo do plano."},{"s":"They differentiated ___ two viruses. (between)","a":"between","why":"differentiate between."},{"s":"He is ___ with saving thousands of lives. (credited)","a":"credited","why":"credit with."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["disease outbreak","surto de doença"],["statistical noise","ruído estatístico"],["patchy data","dados incompletos"],["treatment guideline","diretriz de tratamento"],["epidemiologist","epidemiologista"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["was","he","known","for","What"],"ans":"What was he known for","pt":"Pelo que ele era conhecido?"},{"words":["data","How","did","he","work","with","patchy"],"ans":"How did he work with patchy data","pt":"Como trabalhava com dados incompletos?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"disease outbreak","pos":"word","pt":"surto de doença","ex":"Disease outbreak.","expt":"Surto de doença."},{"w":"statistical noise","pos":"word","pt":"ruído e